/target
**/*.rs.bk
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json.tmp.*
.claude/fanout.lock

# Dispatch scaffolding, written by the orchestrator into a worktree and swept with it. Ignored
# rather than merely excluded by instruction: the api-keys dispatch had to be TOLD not to commit
# these, and an instruction that must be repeated every dispatch is one that will eventually be
# forgotten.
.amk-scope
.amk-task.md
# The dispatch brief. Separate from .amk-task.md because it must NOT be written to a worktree's
# CLAUDE.md: that path is the tracked project CLAUDE.md, so writing the brief there clobbers the
# project rules for the very agent that needs them and leaves the worktree dirty on a tracked file.
# Both happened on the store-http-prereqs dispatch.
.amk-brief.md

# Throwaway venv for the SDK phase gates; see conformance/requirements-gate.txt
.venv-gate/
